e-system/git verification of every claimed commit or deletion.\n- Close-candidate ≠ approved-close: several (e.g. #402 preconditions, #403 --force-flag verify, #394 preconditions) carry unresolved follow-ups that should be re-filed before their parents close.\n- Lock table shows 20 stale locks incl. many classified issues — lock state was treated as noise per SESSION-START, not as activity evidence.","created_at":"2026-08-23T21:54:42.878574885Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:n4Q3/ttJkEw2HPzNL820/BzsztAg5oCTuMeJRjOPUnE","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg6kvdW98yC9bk7SWxlKP1RIEGXGK2CpZI2uKZHZqxF3YAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAQ3EV0fp46mGpvv6opanrSDviRCIcS4w9VQPP5RcCAwlpMzbtlnFCkhhiVbr5fVmnmkLi0WcGsH/XHAlP3xBaBA=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:n4Q3/ttJkEw2HPzNL820/BzsztAg5oCTuMeJRjOPUnE","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg6kvdW98yC9bk7SWxlKP1RIEGXGK2CpZI2uKZHZqxF3YAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMms/AnQ0hdrCzGSAvJ75JhagqKmAn3TLt/D1VoT/PIKXpClKHtdaKnO143PYL/EysSH1D/ve1vqP+66NM0vdwU="}
